  "bug_description": "### 🐛 Describe the bug\n\n```python\n# pyright: strict\nimport torch\n\n@torch.no_grad()\ndef double(x: torch.Tensor) -> torch.Tensor:\n    return 2 * x\n\nreveal_type(double)\n```\n\nmakes `pyright` report `error: Untyped function decorator obscures type of function; ignoring decorator`\n\nThis is because `_NoParamDecoratorContextManager.__new__` is untyped:\n\n\nhttps://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/blob/a4a0378e6bb8afd774e4e253304cf3bf9d7e188a/torch/utils/_contextlib.py#L158-L164\n\n### Versions\n\n`torch==2.10.0a0+git34d6ef7` compiled from source\n\ncc @lolpack @maggiemoss @ndmitchell @kinto0 @samwgoldman",
